 Review comment:
   These defaults are consistent with Couchbase client. Actually, even if I don't set ttl, it will still be 0 in a Couchbase document. So I use those default values to be consistent with Couchbase client API. Otherwise, we need to add extra logic to check those values in read/write function, making it a little more complicated. How do you think?

