-        timerInternals.setTimer(timerData);
+        if (timerData.getTimestamp().isAfter(GlobalWindow.TIMESTAMP_MAX_VALUE)) {

 Review comment:
   Should this be `MAX_TIMESTAMP` (`Long.MAX_VALUE`)? There can be windows between `GlobalWindow.MAX_TIMEMSTAMP` and `MAX_TIMESTAMP` because the former is a standard day before the latter. Actually, `MAX_TIMESTAMP` would be good as a value because triggers using it as a timestamp can never fire because the Watermark cannot go past `MAX_TIMESTAMP`.

